  "Download Link Copied!": "Nakopya ang Download Link!",
  "Copy Download Link (to send via Chat/SMS)": "Kopyahin ang Download Link (para ipadala sa Chat/SMS)",
  "What if Windows says \"Windows protected your PC\"?": "Paano kung sabihin ng Windows na \"Windows protected your PC\"?",
  "Don't worry! This is completely normal for newly downloaded software. Simply click \"More info\", then click the \"Run anyway\" button. iReside is safe, verified, and will install right away.": "Huwag mag-alala! Normal lang ito sa bagong download na software. I-click lang ang \"More info\", tapos i-click ang \"Run anyway\" na button. Ligtas at verified ang iReside, at mai-install agad ito.",
  "How do I install the app on my Android phone?": "Paano ko i-install ang app sa aking Android phone?",
  "Scan the QR code with your phone camera, or click \"Download Android App\". Once downloaded, tap the download notification. If your phone asks permission to install, tap \"Settings\", turn on \"Allow from this source\", and tap \"Install\".": "I-scan ang QR code gamit ang camera ng phone mo, o i-click ang \"I-download ang Android App\". Kapag na-download na, i-tap ang download notification. Kung humingi ng pahintulot ang phone mo na mag-install, i-tap ang \"Settings\", i-on ang \"Allow from this source\", at i-tap ang \"Install\".",
  "Do I need to download both the computer and phone apps?": "Kailangan ko bang i-download pareho ang computer at phone app?",
  "No, only download what you need! Most landlords prefer using a computer or laptop for managing rooms and printing receipts, while tenants love using their phone to pay rent and view bills.": "Hindi, i-download lang ang kailangan mo! Karamihan sa mga landlord ay mas gusto ang computer o laptop sa pamamahala ng mga kwarto at pag-print ng resibo, habang mas gusto ng mga tenant ang phone sa pagbabayad ng upa at pagtingin ng bill.",
  "Can I use both my computer and my phone?": "Pwede ko bang gamitin pareho ang computer at phone ko?",
  "Yes! Everything connects together in real time. If you update something on your computer, it will automatically show up on your phone.": "Oo! Magkakakonekta ang lahat nang real time. Kung may i-update ka sa computer, awtomatiko itong lalabas sa phone mo.",
  "Will my data be lost if I get a new phone or computer?": "Mawawala ba ang datos ko kung magpalit ako ng phone o computer?",
  "No, never! All your properties, tenant records, and payment receipts are safely stored in the cloud. Just log in with your email and password on your new device.": "Hindi, kailanman! Ligtas na nakaimbak sa cloud ang lahat ng iyong paupahan, talaan ng tenant, at resibo ng bayad. Mag-log in ka lang gamit ang email at password sa bago mong device.",
  "You Are Currently Offline": "Offline Ka Ngayon",
  "iReside Turnkey instance is running in local offline mode. You can continue viewing cached property details, leases, and local documentation.": "Tumatakbo ang iReside Turnkey instance sa local offline mode. Maaari mo pa ring tingnan ang naka-cache na detalye ng paupahan, kontrata, at local na dokumentasyon.",
